@* What Pollyanna is, with a nod to the name's regional meaning (spec §7, §12). On home and the signed-out page. *@
<p class="about">Every family has a version of this: names on folded slips, a hat going round the table, someone squinting at the handwriting. Around Philadelphia they call it a Pollyanna. This is the hat, minus the squinting.</p>
